# Client reports — regenerate with:
#   npx playwright test e2e/capture-report.spec.ts && node scripts/build-report.mjs
#   MOBILE_SHOT_DIR=mobile-before npx playwright test e2e/capture-mobile.spec.ts
#   MOBILE_SHOT_DIR=mobile-after  npx playwright test e2e/capture-mobile.spec.ts
#   node scripts/build-mobile-report.mjs
# The screenshots are captured from the running app, so they are build output,
# not source. The finished PDFs are written to the repository root.
#
# The mobile "before" set is the one exception worth knowing about: it can only
# be recaptured by checking out the pre-redesign code, so if it is ever needed
# again it must come from the PDF rather than from a fresh run.
/report-shots/

